          "text": "ኵነኔን ፡ ዑቃቤን ፡ ያዙ ፡ ኵነኔ ፡ ሥጋን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለነፍስ ፡ ማስገዛት ፡ ነው ፡ ዑቃቤ ፡ በዚያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ፡ ጸንቶ ፡ መኖር ፡ ዑቃቤ ፡ ጥገኛ ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኵነኔ ፡ መደበኛ ፡ ወበአምልኮ ፡ ለተአኅዎ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኵነኔ ፡ በዑቃቤም፡ ላይ፡ ንጻሬን፡ ሁሰት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
